--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VENDORED SOURCE redistributed verbatim in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

helm/gibson-operator-crds/files/crds/ contains CustomResourceDefinitions copied
verbatim from the charts above. Helm refuses a CRD and a CR of that CRD in one
release, so the subcharts render with their CRDs off and these copies install
first. They are generated by scripts/vendor-operator-crds.py from the exact
pinned chart version and are not hand-edited.

  cert-manager.yaml       from cert-manager 1.21.1        Apache-2.0
  cloudnative-pg.yaml     from cloudnative-pg 0.29.0      Apache-2.0
  external-secrets.yaml   from external-secrets 2.10.0    Apache-2.0

