CONTAINER IMAGES the charts run
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The charts reference images they do not contain. Pulling an image is not
redistribution, but an air-gap mirror IS: bigbang/images/images.txt is the list
an operator copies into their own registry, and copying carries each image's
own license with it.

One image does not share its chart's license and needs naming:

  Neo4j Community Edition 5.26.0     GPL-3.0     github.com/neo4j/neo4j

    The neo4j HELM CHART is Apache-2.0. The SERVER the chart runs is Neo4j
    Community Edition, which is GPL-3.0. Running it is unaffected. Mirroring
    it into an air-gapped or Iron Bank registry is redistribution of a GPL-3.0
    work and carries that license's source-offer obligation.

    Flagged for counsel, not resolved here.

Every other image is either first-party (ZeroRoot, under its own terms) or an
upstream re-mirrored unchanged under ghcr.io/zeroroot-ai/mirror/, keeping the
upstream license. See bigbang/images/images.yaml for the full inventory.
